title: LoungeDoor_Look
---
Dex: The lounge. I can hear a TV and smell burnt popcorn.
===
title: LoungeDoor_Use
---
<<go lounge from_hallway>>
===

title: Lounge_Enter
---
<<if not flagged("lounge_intro")>>
    Dex: The dorm lounge. One couch, one TV, a thousand questionable stains.
    <<flag lounge_intro>>
<<endif>>
===

title: LoungeExit_Look
---
Dex: Back to the hallway.
===
title: LoungeExit_Use
---
<<go dorm_hallway from_lounge>>
===

title: Couch_Look
---
Dex: A couch older than me, with a permanent butt-shaped dent.
===
title: Couch_Use
---
Dex: If I sit down now, I'll never get up. The night is calling.
===

title: TV_Look
---
<<if flagged("signed_up")>>
    Dex: Roxy Vale, live on the dating channel. Soon that'll be me. On the TV. Not Roxy.
<<else>>
    Dex: It's tuned to the dating channel. Of course it is.
<<endif>>
===
title: TV_Use
---
<<if flagged("signed_up")>>
    Roxy Vale: ...and a big welcome to our newest campus contestants! See you on the show!
    Dex: She means me. I think she means me.
<<elseif flagged("saw_casting_call")>>
    Roxy Vale: Remember, lovers: sign the sheet in your dorm lounge, and bring proof you're a catch!
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: Hi, lovers! It's Roxy Vale, and Speed Daters Live is coming to campus!
    Roxy Vale: Think you're a catch? Sign the sheet in your dorm lounge, and bring proof that someone, somewhere, likes you.
    Dex: Proof. Right. My mom's fridge drawings probably don't count.
    <<flag saw_casting_call>>
<<endif>>
===

title: SignUp_Look
---
<<if flagged("signed_up")>>
    Dex: "Dex Dooley, room 214." Best handwriting of my life.
<<else>>
    Dex: "Speed Daters Live, campus auditions. Sign here. Bring proof you're a catch."
    Dex: There's a pen on a string. Very trusting.
<<endif>>
===
title: SignUp_Use
---
<<if flagged("signed_up")>>
    Dex: My name's on the list. In my best handwriting.
<<elseif has("cowboy_hat")>>
    Dex: "Bring proof you're a catch." I've got Lacey Rae's hat. That's proof if I ever saw it.
    -> Sign up, with the hat as proof
        <<jump SignUp_GiveHat>>
    -> Not yet
        Dex: Maybe I should check myself in a mirror first. No. Later.
<<else>>
    Dex: "Bring proof you're a catch." I pick up the pen... and put it down again.
    Dex: I need someone to vouch for me first. Someone at this party must like me. Eventually.
<<endif>>
===
title: SignUp_GiveHat
---
<<if flagged("signed_up")>>
    Dex: Already signed. Lacey's hat stays with me.
<<else>>
    Dex: Dex Dooley, room 214. Proof of catchiness: one cowboy hat, freely given.
    Dex: I clip the hat to the clipboard and sign with a flourish. The pen string nearly strangles me.
    <<flag signed_up>>
    <<act 2>>
    Roxy Vale: And we have a new contestant! See you on the show, lover boy!
    Dex: Big night out? More like big life out. That didn't make sense. Whatever. I'm in!
    Dex: Thanks for playing the Big Night Out demo. More rooms are on the way.
<<endif>>
===
